" Returns GO terms (biological process, molecular function, cellular "
"component), evidence codes, qualifiers, and references. SGD GO "
"annotations are among the most thoroughly curated in any model organism. "
"Example: S000003219 (RMR1) has annotations for meiotic recombination and "
"cytoplasm localization."
