msgid ""
"**Description**: Search SGD across all data types (genes, GO terms, "
"phenotypes, references, alleles, diseases, complexes, pathways). Returns "
"matching entries with categories, descriptions, and links. Supports "
"category filtering. Example: searching 'GAL4' finds the transcription "
"factor gene, related references, alleles, and GO terms."
msgstr ""

